<ol class="steps">
  <li>You own the game, on a cartridge, a disc or from a store.</li>
  <li>
    You copy it to your computer. That copy is called a <abbr class="caps" title="read-only memory">ROM</abbr>,
    or a game dump.
  </li>
  <li>The port reads your copy on your device, and never uploads it.</li>
</ol>
